            <ArticleTitle>Recurring pain in the pediatric athlete.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1097-112</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Increased interest in youth sports and in physical fitness has led to greater awareness of the pain syndromes that occur in the pediatric athlete. This article examines various pain syndromes in the athlete by anatomic region and offers guidelines for management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
